    "body": "Hello!\r\nI visited the Elixir GitHub repository and found that the \"elixir --short-version\" command \r\nindeed shows \"ELIXIR_VERSION\" written in the bin/elixir.bat file.\r\nThus the approach from #3884 sounds perfect to me.\r\n\r\nMy only concern is that this workaround doesn't work for those who installed elixir by asdf.\r\nIs it acceptable or should we discuss other ways?  🙇 ",
