    "body": "Awesome @falood !   I had no idea the `custom` module existed.  It completely addresses this issue for me.  \r\n\r\nAs an aside, I'm curious about why theres so much time spent in the custom module?  If I run `time elixir --short-version` from my existing shell I get <10ms.  If I do it as a command in custom it takes ~330ms.  Clearly there is a lot of additional work that Starship is doing, but that seems like a pretty significant jump.  Anyway...  At least for me this issue is closed.",
